Tool schema:
{
  "name": "plan_delivery",
  "description": "Plan the stops of a delivery route. The date in `deliver_by` has to be later than the date in `ship_date`. Adding up `parcels` over every entry of `stops` must give `load_total`. One, and only one, of `driver.email` and `driver.phone` has to be present.",
